The adapted registration and reload code was modified on 2026-11-15 to use
Cursor-owned source IDs and the Cursor CLI provider. OAuth authentication,
account management and upstream HTTP endpoints are not included.
Source factory, configuration snapshot/save/rollback and manager synchronization
patterns are also adapted for automatic native Cursor source/model registration.

